# A delegate holding the s, t and w rights appends a message: its flags and keywords are stored
C: a1 APPEND #user.boby.sharedMailbox (\Seen \Flagged $Hidden) {310+}
C: Date: Mon, 7 Feb 1994 21:52:25 -0800 (PST)
C: From: Fred Foobar <foobar@Blurdybloop.COM>
C: Subject: afternoon meeting
C: To: mooch@owatagu.siam.edu
C: Message-Id: <B27397-0100000@Blurdybloop.COM>
C: MIME-Version: 1.0
C: Content-Type: TEXT/PLAIN; CHARSET=US-ASCII
C:
C: Hello Joe, do you think we can meet at 3:30 tomorrow?
C:
S: a1 OK (\[.+\] )?APPEND completed.

C: a2 SELECT #user.boby.sharedMailbox
S: \* OK \[MAILBOXID \(.+\)\] Ok
S: \* FLAGS \(.*\)
S: \* 1 EXISTS
S: \* \d+ RECENT
S: \* OK \[UIDVALIDITY \d+\].*
S: \* OK \[PERMANENTFLAGS .*\].*
S: \* OK \[HIGHESTMODSEQ \d+\].*
S: \* OK \[UIDNEXT 2\].*
S: a2 OK \[READ-WRITE\] SELECT completed.

C: a3 FETCH 1 FLAGS
S: \* 1 FETCH \(FLAGS \(\\Flagged \\Recent \\Seen \$Hidden\)\)
S: a3 OK FETCH completed.
